 * Program ID   : DMF0020_GET_WEEKDATA
 * Description  :
 * Program History
 *===================================================================================================
 *   Date       In Charge      Description
 *===================================================================================================
 * 2019/04/15  JYE         Initial Release [PJ20170278] 전지본부 자동차 GSCM(DM/SCP) 구축 프로젝트
